{
  "key": 20287,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "You crossed the sea to get here?\r",
        "That must have been hard.\r",
        "It would be much easier if your\n",
        "Pokémon knew how to Fly...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "But you can’t use Fly without this\n",
        "city’s Gym Badge.\r",
        "If you beat the Gym Leader here,\n",
        "come see me.\f",
        "I’ll have a nice gift for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s Cianwood’s Gym Badge!\r",
        "Then you should take this HM.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00003",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Teach Fly to your Pokémon.\r",
        "You will be able to Fly instantly\n",
        "to anywhere you have visited."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "My husband lost to you, so he needs\n",
        "to train harder.\r",
        "That’s good, since he was getting a\n",
        "little chubby."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00006",
      "en_US": "Your Bag is full."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "His only hobby is to battle\n",
        "tough Trainers.\r",
        "Do you want to have my\n",
        "husband’s phone number? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Chuck\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "He takes a break from the pounding\n",
        "waterfall on Wednesday nights.\r",
        "He should be able to chat with\n",
        "you then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I see.\n",
        "My husband won’t be a good match?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to exchange your\n",
        "number for my husband’s? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "If you use Fly, you can get back\n",
        "to Olivine instantly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "There are new residents in that house\n",
        "up there. They said they are tutors..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve heard these special items wash\n",
        "up on the coast west of here.\r",
        "They’re supposedly related to a\n",
        "Pokémon that produces pearls..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Eusine: Yo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Wasn’t that Suicune just now?\r",
        "I only caught a quick glimpse, but I\n",
        "thought I saw Suicune running on\f",
        "the waves.\r",
        "Suicune is beautiful and grand.\n",
        "And it races through towns and\f",
        "roads at simply awesome speeds.\r",
        "It’s wonderful...\r",
        "I want to see Suicune up close...\r",
        "I’ve decided.\n",
        "I’ll battle you as a Trainer to earn\f",
        "Suicune’s respect!\r",
        "Come on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Let’s battle now!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re amazing, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "I’m starting to understand why Suicune\n",
        "was keeping an eye on you.\r",
        "I’m going to keep searching\n",
        "for Suicune.\r",
        "I have a feeling we’ll see each other\n",
        "again. See you around!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "There are several islands between\n",
        "here and Olivine.\r",
        "A mythical sea creature supposedly\n",
        "lives there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Cianwood City\n",
        "A Port of Crashing Waves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Cianwood City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Chuck\f",
        "His Roaring Fists Do the Talking"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Cianwood City Pharmacy\r",
        "500 Years of Tradition\n",
        "We Await Your Medicinal Queries"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the house of Cameron,\n",
        "the Photographer.\f",
        "Take a Snapshot as a Keepsake!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Entrance to the road for the\n",
        "Safari Zone.\r",
        "Experience thrilling encounters\n",
        "with wild Pokémon for heart-to-heart\f",
        "contact!\r",
        "The Safari Zone is just around the\n",
        "corner from this entrance!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hello.\r",
        "...\r",
        "A Pikachu was washed up on the shore.\n",
        "It seems it was Surfing, but collapsed.\r",
        "It could do with a kind trainer\n",
        "to take care of it...\r",
        "Oh? Are you a Trainer?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "That Pokémon leading your party...\n",
        "No, never mind..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "That Pokémon leading your party...\n",
        "It’s very happy, isn’t it?\r",
        "Perhaps...\r",
        "Would you be willing to take\n",
        "care of this Pikachu?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "You won’t?\r",
        "How boorish of you..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Excellent... I’m very glad to hear it.\r",
        "Here you go...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "You can’t accept this Pikachu...\n",
        "Your party is completely full."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00029",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the Pikachu!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0572_T24_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you...\r",
        "Do you know of the Battle Frontier?\r",
        "We may meet again if you visit\n",
        "the Battle Castle.\r",
        "A battle? No, I cannot do that...\n",
        "I am sorry. Thank you, again."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
